    test(TJ-DF-044): HOST-DEGRADED-FSISO skip for preflight-promotion test
    
    The DF-044 visibility fix (bridge stderr no longer discarded) surfaces the
    engine's eager DF-15 no-filesystem-isolation warning through the wrapper on
    hosts where the mapped launch is creatable but not file-access-preserving
    (AppArmor). test_preflight_pass_promotes_mapped_flags asserted the warning's
    absence — true only when mapped_file_access_ok() holds. Skip with the
    module's HOST-DEGRADED-FSISO convention on that host class.
